timeline
    title Project Jupiter phases and key dates
    section Approvals, Feb to Dec 2025
        Feb 2025 : Governor announces the campus
        Sep 2025 : County approves $165bn of industrial revenue bonds : Named a Stargate site
        Oct 2025 : Site grading begins
        Late 2025 : About 20 banks lend $18bn
    section Finance and fights, Jan to Sep 2026
        Jan 2026 : Oracle confirmed as tenant
        Mar and Jul 2026 : Pipeline route over state trust land denied twice
        Sep 24 2026 : Force majeure notice reported
    section Power gate, Oct 2026 to Feb 2027
        Nov 23 2026 : Air-permit decision deadline
        Jan 2027 : New land commissioner takes office
        Feb 1 2027 : Gas pipeline in-service target
    section Build-out, 2027 to 2028
        2027 : Fuel cells installed : Four data halls
        2028 : First capacity target
